elf, timing, and via-streets all match.\n\n## Conclusion\nAll three task components were accomplished: a parking area in Salem (Waterfront Garage) was located, a driving route from there to Marblehead was created, and the route is displayed on the map with direction options for understanding.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
